  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e4b5683c1ea36345958694d590b6436, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_BootableF_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: What is the main purpose of a bootable flash drive?
  choices:
  - To increase computer RAM
  - To install or repair an operating system
  - To improve internet speed
  - To increase hard drive capacity
  correctChoiceIndex: 1
  points: 10
  explanation: A bootable flash drive contains the necessary boot files and operating
    system installer so a computer can start from the USB and perform tasks such
    as OS installation or repair.
